只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Self-hosted plugin repository for DeepSeek Harness — a pure Cordis plugin (no changes to @deepseek-ai/ packages).","id":"gh:1340354721","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugin-repo","slug":"Z-6354/dsh-plugin-repo","topics":["cordis-plugin","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","plugin-repository"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Self-hosted plugin repository for DeepSeek Harness — a pure Cordis plugin (no changes to @deepseek-a"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"lugin repository for DeepSeek Harness — a pure Cordis plugin (no changes to @deepseek-ai/ packages)."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-repo"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Self-hosted plugin repository for DeepSeek Harness — a **pure Cordis plugin** (no changes to `@deeps"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"eek-ai/*` packages)."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Each device runs its own repo over HTTP: list / upload / download `.tgz`, detect non-official plugin"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"s, install with version checks, and **pull or push** packages across devices. Official `@deepseek-ai"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"/*` plugins are never listed or modified."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Restart DSH, then open **Settings → 插件仓库**. Prefer a hard refresh (`Ctrl+Shift+R`) after upgrades."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Settings UI (v1.8)"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Tab | Purpose |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| **本机** | Local `.tgz` repo + **installed plugins** (dual pane) |\n| **跨设备同步** | Connect to another "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"DSH; **pull → local** or **push → remote** |\n| **高级** | Extra search roots for discovering plugins |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Installed plugins (v1.7+):**"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- **启用 / 关闭** — toggles `dsh.profile.bundles` without removing dependencies (restart required)\n- **删"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"除** — uninstall from web profile when plugin is **disabled** (`pnpm remove` / `dsh plugin remove`)\n-"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" **从 npm 安装** — `pnpm add` / `dsh plugin add` into web profile\n- **DSH 版本适配** — reads `peerDependenc"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ies` and compares with running `@deepseek-ai/dsh`"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Cross-device sync uses a dual pane (local | remote). Badges show concrete versions (`本机 1.5.2 > 对方 1"},{"id":"p13s2","text":".5.0`). Use **选需推送** / **选需拉取** to select only packages that differ (including **version unknown → d"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"efault push**). Push confirms warn on downgrade; equal packages show as already synced. **最近推送** rec"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"ords persist under `repoDir/push-history.json` across restarts and explain whether remote was alread"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"y unknown vs push stripped the version."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Cross-device access (v1.8+)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Cross-device requests are issued by the **local DSH server** (not the browser). This plugin does **n"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ot** embed login credentials."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"When the remote device uses **dsh-local-hanaccount**:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. **Recommended:** pair devices in **Settings → 访问控制 → 对等设备** on both sides. Outbound `fetch` from "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"DSH will automatically attach the peer Bearer token.\n2. **Single-side hc:** on the device with hc, a"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"dd `/pluginrepo` to **显式暴露** (exclude) so LAN peers can sync without pairing."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Plain LAN `http://ip:3080` without hc continues to work. On HTTP 401/403 the UI points to hc pairing"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" or explicit expose — not HTTP Basic in this plugin."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Repository storage"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Default under the configured `repoDir` (often `~/.dsh/plugin-repo` or a custom path):"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- `packages/<name>.tgz` — non-official packages\n- `index.json` — metadata (`name`, `version`, `filen"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ame`, `size`, `uploadedAt`)"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## HTTP API (on the DSH web port, e.g. `http://127.0.0.1:3080`)"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Method | Path | Description |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| GET | `/pluginrepo` | HTML landing |\n| GET | `/pluginrepo/api/packages` | List repo packages |\n| G"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ET | `/pluginrepo/api/unofficial` | Installed + repo non-official plugins |\n| POST | `/pluginrepo/ap"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"i/upload` | Upload `.tgz` (raw body; `?name=` optional) |\n| GET | `/pluginrepo/download/<file>.tgz` "},{"id":"p24s4","text":"| Download |\n| GET/POST | `/pluginrepo/api/remote` | List another device’s packages (`POST` body: `h"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ost`, optional `port`) |\n| POST | `/pluginrepo/api/remote-pull` | Pull from another device into **th"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"is** repo |\n| POST | `/pluginrepo/api/remote-push` | Push local-repo `.tgz` to another device |\n| PO"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"ST | `/pluginrepo/api/install` | Plan / confirm install into local profile |\n| POST | `/pluginrepo/a"},{"id":"p24s8","text":"pi/profile/enable` | Enable plugin in `dsh.profile.bundles` |\n| POST | `/pluginrepo/api/profile/disa"},{"id":"p24s9","text":"ble` | Disable plugin (remove from bundles) |\n| POST | `/pluginrepo/api/profile/uninstall` | Uninsta"},{"id":"p24s10","text":"ll disabled plugin from profile |\n| POST | `/pluginrepo/api/npm-add` | Install from npm registry (`s"},{"id":"p24s11","text":"pec`, `confirm`) |\n| DELETE | `/pluginrepo/api/packages/<key>` | Delete a repo package |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Remote address parse order: **scheme → host → port**. Bare host → `http` + port `3080`; `https://` →"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" port `443`; explicit `:port` wins. Userinfo in URLs is stripped and ignored."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Model tools"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- `repo_list` / `repo_unofficial` / `repo_push` / `repo_pull` / `repo_delete`\n- `repo_remote` / `rep"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"o_remote_pull` / `repo_remote_push`\n- `repo_install` (requires `installConfirm=true` to apply)"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Optional plugin config:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- `repoDir` — absolute repository directory\n- `logLevel` — `silent` | `info`"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"> **Note:** Use schemastery-style config (fields optional by default). Do **not** call zod’s `.optio"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"nal()` on schemastery schemas."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
